// The shared (Veldin-address) moby classes of the weapons, gadgets and the Vendor that no level ported: class 1143 (the Vendor
// Orb, spawned by the Vendor's update), 479 (the Drone Device's drones), 270 (the Morph-o-Ray's chicken) with 428 (the chicken's
// debris, spawned by its update), 804 (a piece on the Morph-o-Ray's hand moby) and 166; the Morph-o-Ray's HUD element (slot 4, key
// 0x7533: start / update / draw, set by its hand update 0x2bc7e8) and particle types 5's and 0x37's updates (0x37: the drones'
// particles, spawned through 0x2725d8), at Veldin's addresses
// Transliterated instruction by instruction from Veldin's own overlay with tools/codegen/mips2cpp.py (tools/codegen/mkall.py:
// the original's control flow and PS2 float rules by construction), not rewritten
// by hand: the names are the classes', the helpers `ovl_<addr>_tr` (uniform ABI: TrRet).
